OL,3,GNEWSAChloe Mitchell killer had prior
OL,4,Aparanoid schizophrenia diagnosis, court
OL,5,Atold
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis article contains details that some
OL,8,Fmay find distressing
OL,10,FThe man accused of murdering Chloe
OL,11,FMitchell was previously diagnosed with
OL,12,Fparanoid schizophrenia, his defence
OL,13,Fbarrister has told jurors.
OL,15,FDes Fahy KC said Brandon Rainey
OL,16,Faccepted that he killed Chloe but would
OL,17,Frely on the partial defence of
OL,18,Fdiminished responsibility.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
